{
  "name": "SOC 2 Retention Enforcer",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 2 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "9694cd79-bbb6-4cb9-a4f9-5fbd2d1b344f",
      "name": "Daily Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "YOUR_SUPABASE_PROJECT_URL/rest/v1/ai_audit_log",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "status",
              "value": "eq.active"
            },
            {
              "name": "retention_expires_at",
              "value": "={{ \"lt.\" + $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY"
            },
            {
              "name": "Prefer",
              "value": "return=representation"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"status\": \"expired\"}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bd00320a-7a5c-42c8-9a38-e962edeb24b1",
      "name": "Flag Expired Entries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        224,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json;\nconst count = Array.isArray(body) ? body.length : 0;\nreturn [{ json: { enforced_at: new Date().toISOString(), entries_expired: count } }];"
      },
      "id": "79859ec0-5899-41b0-b5f0-a9e5bab8ccbd",
      "name": "Count Expired Entries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a47c44e7-fcd5-479a-988c-83d683dc3778",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SOC 2 Retention Enforcer\n\nRuns daily at 2:00 AM. Flags all active audit log entries past their 90-day retention window as `expired` in a single batch PATCH to Supabase.\n\n**Flow:** Daily cron \u2192 PATCH Supabase (status=expired where retention_expires_at < now) \u2192 count entries flagged\n\n**SOC 2 TSC:** Supports evidence collection for CC6.5 (logical access: discontinuation of access to protected information).\n\n**Note:** Entries are flagged, not deleted. Immutability is enforced by Supabase RLS: INSERT only, no DELETE.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 720,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "21b9af56-3115-4c37-93d5-279b0b89826b",
      "name": "Prerequisites",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prerequisites\n\n1. `ai_audit_log` table created by the Audit Log Pipeline\n   (includes `status` and `retention_expires_at` columns)\n2. Supabase anon key and service key",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9c8551e6-c586-46e8-b963-d65ac29bb791",
      "name": "Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        380,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuration\n\nIn **Flag Expired Entries**: replace:\n- `YOUR_SUPABASE_PROJECT_URL`\n- `YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`\n- `YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY`\n\nCron runs at **2:00 AM** in your n8n instance timezone.\nAdjust the schedule in **Daily Schedule** if needed.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 1
      }
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
